      "content": "D. Transportation Methods"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8wplb7m",
      "content": "• Traction – rolling of large particles."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lrxkkhq",
      "content": "• Saltation – bouncing movement."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
