      "content": "• Solution – dissolved load."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Differentiate Weathering (in-situ disintegration) from Mass Wasting (gravity-driven downslope movement) and Erosion (transportation via mobile agents).",
        "Focus on specific river transportation mechanisms: Traction (rolling along bed), Saltation (bouncing), and Suspension (carried in water column).",
        "Understand the concept of Sea Level as the Ultimate Base Level of erosion."
      ],
